---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="id"
  title="Hubungi Kami | SaveEditor.Online"
  description="Hubungi tim kami secara langsung untuk laporan bug, saran, atau pertanyaan lainnya."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 max-w-6xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Hubungi Kami</h1>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
      <div>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
          Punya pertanyaan, keluhan, saran, atau sekadar ingin memberikan masukan? Kami senang mendengarnya. Silakan hubungi kami melalui saluran di bawah ini.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-100 mb-2">Waktu Respon</h3>
          <p class="text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm mb-4">
            Kami berusaha membalas semua pesan dalam waktu <strong>24 hingga 48 jam</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl"
            >
              📧
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Email Dukungan</div>
              <a href="mailto:support@saveeditor.top" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline"
                >support@saveeditor.top</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div
              class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xl"
            >
              🐛
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Laporan Masalah (GitHub)</div>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/paradoxie/saveeditor/issues"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="text-primary-600 hover:underline">Laporkan masalah langsung di GitHub kami</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
